10 REM THE TUBE DEMOS: CD /LANG/BBCBASIC, BBC, LOAD "EX/NAME.BBC" THEN RUN. ESCAPE STOPS ONE.
20 PRINT "KALEID   a kaleidoscope of mirrored lines"
30 PRINT "CIRCLES  random filled circles (any key leaves)"
40 PRINT "ROSES    rose curves, a new one every few seconds"
50 PRINT "CLOCK    an analogue clock on the machine clock"
60 PRINT "TUNE     Frere Jacques, a round for 3 voices"
70 PRINT "BOUNCE   a bouncing ball with a blip"
80 PRINT "MOUNTAIN a scrolling mountain ridge"
82 PRINT "SPRITES  64 hardware sprites: eight balls drawn once, then VICKY moves them"
84 PRINT "INVADERS a marching, animated, flipping row of captured sprites"
86 PRINT "TUNNEL   a palette-cycling tunnel: fifteen circles, no redrawing"
90 END
